    given-names: Guillermo
    email: gfandos@ucm.es
    affiliation: "Dpto. Biodiversidad, Ecología y Evolución, Universidad Complutense de Madrid"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0003-1579-9444"
keywords:
  - bats
  - species distribution models
  - Iberian Peninsula
  - favorability
  - atlas
  - chiroptera
  - SDM
  - uncertainty
